===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|flemmysshe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|flēmisc}}, from {{der|en|ofs|flāmisk}}, derived from {{der|en|gem-pro|*flaumaz|t=flowing, current water}} and {{m|gem-pro|*-iskaz}}. Equivalent to English {{suffix|en|fleam|ish}}. More at {{l|en|Flanders}}.

